WEBVTT - Typewright: overview film (en)

1
00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:06.702
One page, four languages, a dozen images, and a
deadline.

2
00:00:07.802 --> 00:00:17.611
Typewright is a calm Mac workspace for TYPO3.
Your drafts stay on your Mac. TYPO3 stays in
charge of publishing.

3
00:00:18.861 --> 00:00:25.274
Pages look the way TYPO3 shows them, and
language tabs count what is translated.

4
00:00:26.324 --> 00:00:32.502
The page assistant places a new page in five
steps and keeps it hidden until it is ready.

5
00:00:33.552 --> 00:00:40.983
Add an element from TYPO3’s own wizard, Content
Blocks included, and fill it in right away.

6
00:00:42.033 --> 00:00:48.733
Move elements between columns, duplicate or hide
them, and switch languages with one tab.

7
00:00:49.783 --> 00:00:55.961
Page properties, from the URL path to the search
description, in every language.

8
00:00:57.011 --> 00:01:03.998
Edit every field TYPO3 defines, including tabs,
questions and other collections.

9
00:01:05.048 --> 00:01:13.054
Rich text keeps TYPO3’s markup: abbreviations,
language spans, classes and images.

10
00:01:14.104 --> 00:01:20.438
Press ⌘K to link a page, a content anchor, a
file or a record.

11
00:01:21.488 --> 00:01:28.084
News articles get their images and videos,
related links, categories and tags.

12
00:01:29.134 --> 00:01:36.147
Drafts stay on your Mac. ⌘S sends them to TYPO3,
and the save bar confirms it.

13
00:01:37.197 --> 00:01:43.845
The media library browses TYPO3’s folders and
edits metadata in every language.

14
00:01:44.895 --> 00:01:50.106
Uploads show their progress and land in TYPO3’s
file storage.

15
00:01:51.156 --> 00:01:55.400
Each use of an image gets its own alternative
text.

16
00:01:56.450 --> 00:02:02.445
Translate with TYPO3’s own command, with the
original right under each field.

17
00:02:03.495 --> 00:02:08.889
Review every change in a workspace, and publish
only after you confirm.

18
00:02:10.189 --> 00:02:14.486
Typewright, by webconsulting. Ask us for a
demonstration.
